    asmput("# An index slot is 0 (empty) or (hash << 33) | (1 + pair position), so the")
    asmput("# key's 31-bit hash is in the high bits. A probe that lands on another key's")
    asmput("# slot (common under linear probing) is turned away by comparing those bits,")
    asmput("# without loading that key from the pair region or its length from the key")
