    // any name still pointing at it would leave the map holding a key it
    // can't find, and could make two different keys the same text. Flags bit
    // 2 marks it, and a write through another name faults at the write. A
    // literal key needs nothing: the pool is already read-only, and its flags
    // word is shared by every use of the same literal.
